{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Aperture Dating Simulator isn't your average fan-made Portal game...</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in an alternate universe from the series that inspired it, APDS will introduce you to a new Aperture - one that seems a lot more... normal than the original. At first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a manufacturing employee thrust out of their element and into maintenance, where you'll meet 8 brand-new personality cores, each with their own special little quirks. From level-headed supervisor Miss Esther to hot-tempered sports fanatic Rob, there's plenty of new &quot;faces&quot; to get to know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aperture Dating Simulator is <strong>fully voiced</strong> by a group of independent voice actors and programmed by a single developer. With <strong>19 endings</strong> to discover and <strong>more than 40 cutscenes</strong> to unlock, there's a lot this tropey little dating sim parody has to offer. Or so we hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What do you have to lose? Your dignity? If you're reading this, it's already gone.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3723280?t=1761534536","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3723280?t=1761534536","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723280/1cf94fc051a70d6279a0681bb23c7c3dcef21490/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761534536","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723280/1cf94fc051a70d6279a0681bb23c7c3dcef21490/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761534536","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Aperture Dating Simulator isn't your average fan-made Portal game...</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in an alternate universe from the series that inspired it, APDS will introduce you to a new Aperture - one that seems a lot more... normal than the original. At first.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of a manufacturing employee thrust out of their element and into maintenance, where you'll meet 8 brand-new personality cores, each with their own special little quirks. From level-headed supervisor Miss Esther to hot-tempered sports fanatic Rob, there's plenty of new &quot;faces&quot; to get to know.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aperture Dating Simulator is <strong>fully voiced</strong> by a group of independent voice actors and programmed by a single developer. With <strong>19 endings</strong> to discover and <strong>more than 40 cutscenes</strong> to unlock, there's a lot this tropey little dating sim parody has to offer. Or so we hope.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What do you have to lose? Your dignity? If you're reading this, it's already gone.</p>","developers":["Ashleyanna Rivers"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3723280/b1611640f46808b1bd01d25f4442d181752c2d10/header.jpg?t=1761534536","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 16.04+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2.0 Ghz 64-bit Intel